-**Read cold.** Before release, the certificate was read by a reader other than its writer, with the compiled project at hand. The reader re-read every definition in the statements against this paper, re-elaborated from source the files of the Main Theorem and of Theorem DW and five more of the chain, and compared the rule with Smith forms it computed from the graphs (`n ≤ 11`). Verdict: «holds as far as I can check»; no Lean statement says something other than this paper. It found four errors in the record and none in a statement: one sentence, the description of the edges of the folded cube in §1.3 of version 8 of this paper, which the certificate repeated (corrected in §1.3 here and in [LC26]), and three counts of the certificate (corrected in [LC26]).
